{"steam_appid":3977290,"steam_name":"Rewind 99","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3977290/2127329084/fd5958bb5ac89e86fdf5f1104bfbc105d4d95855/1771882502/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771887399","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257293197/461a75866f10bb98f61ee868e3904fc8a7e5b759/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771887399","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/e45574111e9f82258b245edee6dbe9caa4cc1943/ss_e45574111e9f82258b245edee6dbe9caa4cc1943.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785862058","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/e24e305746174bc76965b7e0fa72d9ad4acd06c7/ss_e24e305746174bc76965b7e0fa72d9ad4acd06c7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785862058","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/acc19f65fc5c052ca71ca867d1ed1c38f71a40c3/ss_acc19f65fc5c052ca71ca867d1ed1c38f71a40c3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785862058","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/355713b3c2b71804b2a604f4c43a17c901086c3b/ss_355713b3c2b71804b2a604f4c43a17c901086c3b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785862058","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/01f31d23e33e266b002431e25d28814111d24770/ss_01f31d23e33e266b002431e25d28814111d24770.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785862058"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You’re not just running a video rental store.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You’re running out of time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/6a0ebbfc0a611d4bc7f89ef32461de88.poster.avif?t=1785862058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/6a0ebbfc0a611d4bc7f89ef32461de88.webm?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/6a0ebbfc0a611d4bc7f89ef32461de88.mp4?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>RUN THE WORLD'S LAST VIDEO RENTAL STORE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve inherited the last video rental store in town. You're broke, drowning in late returns, and streaming giant RentNet just opened across the street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your store by day.<br>Do whatever it takes to survive by night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay in business, the more chaotic things become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR STORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order movies, snacks, toys, and rare collectibles. Stock shelves, manage customers, and expand your store from a dying shop into a thriving business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees, automate operations, and optimize every inch of your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision determines whether you survive another week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and did we mention we have PLENTY of store customization options?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/fed17af0a293260475d097d0f1419687.poster.avif?t=1785862058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/fed17af0a293260475d097d0f1419687.webm?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/fed17af0a293260475d097d0f1419687.mp4?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/ac288f6d0e18d540ebc2a5c4c56a4e71.poster.avif?t=1785862058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/ac288f6d0e18d540ebc2a5c4c56a4e71.webm?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/ac288f6d0e18d540ebc2a5c4c56a4e71.mp4?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUSTLE TO SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store alone isn’t enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run underground fight clubs. Gamble on scratcher tickets. Install a claw machine. Take on shady side hustles across the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will make you rich.<br>Some will ruin you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/278bf96be9b76fd7cbdf821eda95d214.poster.avif?t=1785862058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/278bf96be9b76fd7cbdf821eda95d214.webm?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/278bf96be9b76fd7cbdf821eda95d214.mp4?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/18c6696db5232b33c91b5ad85b7f926e.poster.avif?t=1785862058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/18c6696db5232b33c91b5ad85b7f926e.webm?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/18c6696db5232b33c91b5ad85b7f926e.mp4?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR OWN FILM EMPIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce and release your own original films to compete with RentNet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage production, release films, and turn your store into something far bigger than a rental shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/9bf9d2dc4e08aa654834ce4d55851d9a.poster.avif?t=1785862058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/9bf9d2dc4e08aa654834ce4d55851d9a.webm?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/9bf9d2dc4e08aa654834ce4d55851d9a.mp4?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A CITY FULL OF OPPORTUNITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a low-poly open city by foot or scooter. Discover secrets, track NPC schedules, and unlock increasingly dangerous and lucrative opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/1b133042fe9e9bb9af28b3f07e09d95e.poster.avif?t=1785862058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/1b133042fe9e9bb9af28b3f07e09d95e.webm?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/1b133042fe9e9bb9af28b3f07e09d95e.mp4?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/635c3a404f8b3bc81f4aa20e8ab99966.poster.avif?t=1785862058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/635c3a404f8b3bc81f4aa20e8ab99966.webm?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/635c3a404f8b3bc81f4aa20e8ab99966.mp4?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY SOLO OR WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the store alone or with friends in co-op multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide responsibilities, expand faster, and take bigger risks together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/8579e344d85a08d2c1f4c70b1a6702bb.poster.avif?t=1785862058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/8579e344d85a08d2c1f4c70b1a6702bb.webm?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/8579e344d85a08d2c1f4c70b1a6702bb.mp4?t=1785862058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >100% HUMAN-MADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every asset, illustration, and piece of marketing was created by real artists.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz 4-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.5GHz 6-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3060 or Radeon RX 6700<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["Gunmetal Games","Real Fake Games"],"publishers":["Gunmetal Games"],"release_date":"11 Mar, 2026"}